      "summary": "**Shell.** `QuestionnaireBuilderPage` (props `{scope: QuestionnaireScope, id: string}`) is mounted at `/facility/:fid/settings/questionnaires/:id/edit` (src/pages/Facility/settings/layout.tsx:283) and `/admin/questionnaires/:id/edit` (src/Routers/routes/adminRoutes.tsx:39). It fetches via `useQuery(questionnaireKeys.detail(id))`, holds ALL edit state in `useReducer(builderReducer, {questions:[], selectedId:null, dirty:false})`, and re-seeds from the server only when `questionnaire` changes AND `!state.dirty` (guard against refetch clobbering edits). Query params: `?mode=preview` seeds the view, `?import=1` opens the import dialog then is stripped from the URL on mount. `useNavigationPrompt(state.dirty, t(\"unsaved_changes_warning\"))` is the only \"discard\" protection — the Cancel button is a plain `navigate(backPath)` with **no reducer-level revert**. Save = `findFirstInvalidQuestion(state.questions)` → on failure `toast.error(t(messageKey))` + `dispatch({type:\"select\"})` + `setView(\"edit\")`; on success `save(buildUpdateBody(questionnaire, {questions}))` through `useUpdateQuestionnaire(id, onSaved)` whose `onSaved` dispatches `reset` with `keepSelectedId` so the author keeps their place. Save is `disabled={!state.dirty || isPending}` and gated on `canWrite`.\n\n**Layout today is 2-pane, one-question-at-a-time.** Header strip: Back + `EditPreviewToggle` | Cancel link + Save Changes. Edit view: `w-72` sticky left `BuilderTreeNav` (`md:` only) + a `md:hidden` `<Select>` mobile fallback + `flex-1` column holding a single `QuestionEditorCard` (or `BuilderEmptyState`) and a sticky bottom Previous / Add new question / Next bar that paginates **top-level questions only** via `findTopLevelIndex`. Preview view swaps the whole body for `QuestionnaireRenderer` fed a `useMemo`'d `{...questionnaire, questions: state.questions}` — that memo identity is load-bearing (the renderer's jotai store re-seeds and wipes in-progress preview answers on identity change