    "manage": {
      "summary": "**Scope & mounting.** `QuestionnaireScope` (src/types/questionnaire/questionnaire.ts:37-61) is `{ basePath: string } &` a union discriminated on `authContext` ∈ instance | facility | facility_organization | user; every key is declared on every member so consumers read `scope.facilityId` without narrowing. Only two mounts exist: `INSTANCE_SCOPE` (adminRoutes.tsx:22-25, basePath `/admin/questionnaires`) and facility (layout.tsx:259-319, basePath `/facility/${facilityId}/settings/questionnaires`, rebuilt as an inline literal in each of 5 routes). `facility_organization`/`user` are typed but never mounted. Pages never read route params. Route order is load-bearing: `new`, `:id/edit`, `:id/versions/:revisionId` must precede `:id` (raviger matches in object order), and facility routes must precede the `\"*\"` ErrorPage.\n\n**Detail page.** One `<Form>` → `<form onSubmit>` → `<Tabs>` (questions | versions, `defaultValue` from `?tab=versions`). Sticky header (back+breadcrumb, title h1 + authContext/status/revision badges, Cancel + \"Save Questionnaire\" submit, TabsList). Questions tab is `md:grid-cols-[1fr_280px]`: left = BasicInformationCard (OrganizationsField as children) + QuestionOverviewList; right = FormPropertiesSidebar with three LabeledActionButtons as children (Preview / Clone / Download JSON).\n\n**Builder entry.** All via `navigate()`: `${basePath}/${id}/edit` (QuestionOverviewList: header Edit Questions, empty-state Add first, row dropdown Edit, dashed Add question; VersionsTab \"Continue Editing\"), `?import=1` (Import questions), `?mode=preview` (sidebar Preview). Builder consumes both params, strips `import` via `setQueryParams(rest,{overwrite:true,replace:true})`. **The builder has zero questionnaire-level fields today** — left w-72 BuilderTreeNav, center QuestionEditorCard, no right panel.\n\n**Editable questionnaire-level fields.** `DetailFormValues` = title, slug, description, status — all four submit together. subject_type is create-only (static Badge on detail, SegmentedRadioGroup on create constrained by `SUBJECT_TYPES_FOR_CONTEXT`). `version` (string \"1.0\") and `code` are never surfaced but are round-tripped by buildUpdateBody. `internal_revision` is read-only. **`tags` does not exist** anywhere on the questionnaire type or UI. Organizations are *not* in the form: OrganizationsField fires its own immediate POST per toggle (instance → set_organizations with optimistic chips + rollback; facility → set_facility_organizations; other contexts → `null`), `silent:true` GET, 403 → OrganizationsUnavailableCard.\n\n**Versions/revisions.** No revision endpoints exist. VersionsTab reuses `questionnaireApi.list` with `{ parent_revision: id, limit: 100 }`; revisions are full questionnaire rows, so QuestionnaireRevisionPage reuses `questionnaireApi.get` with the revision id and renders `QuestionnaireRenderer mode=\"readonly\"`. Past-revision status badges are hardcoded \"Retired\" (backend doesn't carry historical status). **Publish does not exist** — no action, no endpoint, no draft→published transition; flipping `status` on the same PUT is the only approximation. **Save is not client-side revisioning**: the client only PUTs a full body; revision creation/archival is entirely backend-side and nothing in the frontend names or controls it. There is no restore/revert action.\n\n**Save flow.** `useUpdateQuestionnaire(id, onSaved?)` is the single mutation for detail + builder: PUT `/api/v1/questionnaire/{id}/`, then `setQueryData(detail(id), updated)` **before** `invalidateQueries({queryKey: all})`, then toast, then `onSaved`. `buildUpdateBody` copies exactly 8 writable fields (slug, version `String()`-coerced, code, questions, title, description, status, subject_type) then spreads the patch; read-only fields must never be echoed. Detail submits `{title,slug,description,status}`; reorder submits `{questions}`; builder submits `{questions}` after `findFirstInvalidQuestion`.\n\n**Statuses.** `[\"active\",\"draft\",\"retired\"]` → colors primary/yellow/destructive. List page tabs derive from the array via a total Record (new status = compile error). Create defaults \"active\"; clone always \"draft\".\n\n**API.** list, get, create (legacy), createV2, update (PUT), partialUpdate (PATCH — unused), delete (unused), submit, get/setOrganizations, get/setFacilityOrganizations, add/removeFavorite + listFavorites (unused).\n\n**Inspector candidates.** Cleanest to move: status (already sidebar-shaped), title/slug/description, subject_type (static row), version badge, Clone + Download JSON. Preview becomes redundant (EditPreviewToggle). Organizations moves but is the odd one — instant-save inside a dirty/Save-Changes shell. Main friction: builder uses `useReducer` with no RHF while detail uses RHF+zod, so dirty-tracking, `useNavigationPrompt`, and the refetch-must-not-clobber guard need unifying.",
