ere but would compile fine; note the codebase uses `gray-*` not `neutral-*` throughout.\n\n**Radix wrappers available** (see file list). Popover, DropdownMenu, Select, Tabs, Switch, Checkbox, RadioGroup, Collapsible, Dialog, Sheet, Drawer (vaul), Command (cmdk), HoverCard, ContextMenu, Menubar, Tooltip, ScrollArea, Slider, Progress, Separator, Accordion, AlertDialog. **No `toggle.tsx` / `toggle-group.tsx`** — `@radix-ui/react-toggle` and `-toggle-group` are NOT installed. Segmented controls are hand-rolled: `SegmentedRadioGroup.tsx` (roving-tabindex `role=\"radiogroup\"`, `gap-px` over `bg-gray-200` for dividers, active = `bg-primary-50 text-primary-800` — note the dead `primary-50`), and `EditPreviewToggle.tsx` (pill toggle: `rounded-full bg-gray-100 p-1`, active pill `bg-white text-gray-900 shadow-sm`). Tab conventions: base `Tabs` is a shadcn pill list, but the repo's real pattern is the **underline variant** used by both `nav-tabs.tsx` and `filter-tabs.tsx`: list `border-b rounded-none bg-transparent p-0 h-auto`, trigger `border-b-3 text-gray-600 data-[state=active]:border-b-primary-700 data-[state=active]:text-primary-800 data-[state=active]:bg-transparent data-[state=active]:shadow-none`. Both also implement overflow-to-DropdownMenu (\"N more\"). A global rule in index.css:697 forces `[data-slot=\"tabs-trigger\"]` inactive text to `text-gray-500`.\n\n**A working 3-pane questionnaire builder already exists** at `src/components/QuestionnaireV2/builder/` + `renderer/` + `shared/` — reuse it rather than rebuilding: `QuestionnaireBuilderPage.tsx` (w-72 sticky tree nav + flex-1 editor + sticky bottom action bar, mobile falls back to a `Select`), `QuestionTreeNav.tsx`, `questionTypeIcons.ts` (type→lucide icon + `bg-X-100 text-X-700` tint), `QuestionTypeBadge.tsx`, `CollapsibleSettingsCard.tsx`, `ChoiceChip.tsx`, `LabeledActionButton.tsx`.",
