      "summary": "**Scope.** 23 spec files under `tests/facility/settings/questionnaires/` (63 test cases) and 6 under `tests/admin/questionnaires/` (12 cases). All use `test.use({ storageState: \"tests/.auth/user.json\" })` except `admin/questionnaires/questionnairePermissions.spec.ts` (`tests/.auth/nurse.json`, read-only user) and `questionnaireMobile.spec.ts` (adds `viewport: {width:375,height:812}`).\n\n**How tests reach the builder.** Two mounts share one component (`src/components/QuestionnaireV2/builder/QuestionnaireBuilderPage.tsx`), registered at `/facility/:facilityId/settings/questionnaires/:id/edit` (`src/pages/Facility/settings/layout.tsx:282`) and `/admin/questionnaires/:id/edit` (`src/Routers/routes/adminRoutes.tsx:38`). Paths are built from `basePath` = `` `/facility/${getFacilityId()}/settings/questionnaires` `` or `/admin/questionnaires`. Three entry styles: (1) `openQuestionBuilder(page)` — clicks detail-page `button \"Edit Questions\"` then `waitForURL(/\\/edit$/)`; (2) direct `page.goto(...)` with `?mode=preview` (preview-only specs) or `?import=1` (import deep-link, param stripped after the dialog opens); (3) detail-page quick actions `button \"Preview questionnaire\"` → `/edit?mode=preview` and `button \"Import Questions\"` → `/edit?import=1`. `createQuestionnaireAndOpenBuilder` = create-form flow + `openQuestionBuilder`, returning the *detail* URL (specs regex `questionnaires\\/([0-9a-f-]+)` out of it for API assertions).\n\n**Builder-dependent (would break under a 3-pane canvas+inspector redesign) — 21 files.** Whole-file: `questionnaireBuilder`, `questionnaireBuilderGroups`, `questionnaireBuilderMatrix`, `questionnaireBuilderNavigation`, `questionnaireBuilderValidation`, `questionnaireChoiceOptions`, `questionnaireConditionsAuthoring`, `questionnaireEnableWhen`, `questionnaireErrorHandling`, `questionnaireImportClone`, `questionnaireImportUrl`, `questionnaireQuantityUnit`, `questionnaireRepeats`, `questionnaireVersions`. Partly: `questionnaireUnitSemantics` (2/3 author in builder, 1 is fixture-preview), `questionnaireEnableWhenMatrix` (5/6 preview-only, the \"empty states\" test uses builder Preview↔Edit toggle + Import), `questionnaireDetailActions` (the kebab-reorder test authors via builder import/save; \"Preview Form quick action\" asserts builder preview chrome), `questionnaireMobile` (2nd test asserts the builder's mobile Select fallback), `questionnairePreviewTypes` (no authoring, but every test enters via `/edit?mode=preview` and depends on the builder's preview `navigation` landmark), `admin/questionnairePermissions` (deep-links `/admin/questionnaires/{id}/edit`, asserts \"Question Title\" present + \"Save Changes\" absent; another test asserts detail lacks \"Edit Questions\").\n\n**Safe (list/create/detail/versions/orgs) — 8 files.** `facility/questionnaireList`, `facility/questionnairePagination`, `facility/questionnaireCreate`, `facility/questionnaireCreateValidation`, `admin/questionnaireList`, `admin/questionnaireDetail`, `admin/questionnaireScoping`, `admin/questionnaireVersionsDepth`, `admin/questionnaireOrganizations`, plus `questionnaireMobile` test 1. These only touch `[data-slot=\"table-body\"]`, `getByPlaceholder(\"Search Questionnaires\")`, `radiogroup \"Status\"/\"Subject Type\"`, `textbox \"Title\"/\"Slug\"`, `button \"Save Questionnaire\"`, `tab \"Versions\"`, `#page-1`/`#page-2`, and the read-only revision viewer (`/versions/{id}`, \"Past revision\", disabled `Enter details`).\n\n**Selector style.** Zero `data-cy` / `data-testid` anywhere in these specs (one exception: `getByTestId(\"valueset-search-results\")` in previewTypes). Everything is `getByRole` + accessible name, plus a handful of structural escape hatches: `[data-slot=\"card\"]` (editor card scope), `[data-slot=\"command-item\"][data-value=\"<type>\"]` (type picker — the only unambiguous hook because option names include descriptions), `[data-slot=\"command-input\"]`, `div[class*=\"sm:grid-cols-2\"]` (condition grid), `fieldset[class*=\"grid-cols-2\"]`, `span.text-red-500`, `span.bg-amber-500`, `input[type=\"file\"]`, `[data-radix-popper-content-wrapper]`.\n\n**Shared helpers.** `tests/helper/questionnaireV2.ts` exports fixture slugs, `adminApiHeaders()`/`apiBaseUrl()`, `getQuestionnaireIdBySlug()` (lists `?limit=100` and matches client-side — slug lookup was dropped in ENG-737), `QUESTIONNAIRE_DETAIL_URL`, `createQuestionnaire`, `openQuestionBuilder`, `createQuestionnaireAndOpenBuilder`, `pickValuesetFromAutocomplete`. `tests/helper/ui.ts` supplies `expectToast` and `selectFromValueSet`. Per-spec local helpers repeated across files (all builder-coupled): `addQuestion`, `pickType`, `importQuestions`/`importStringQuestions`, `selectInNav`, `editorCard`, `conditionGrid`, `openVisibilityCard`, `jumpTo`/`navRow`, `openKitchenSinkPreview`, `trackQuestionnairePutRequests`.\n\n**Fixtures.** Backend-seeded (from the care repo's E2E fixture script, baked into the Playwright DB snapshot): `e2e-kitchen-sink-facility`, `e2e-kitchen-sink-instance`, `e2e-versioned` (3 revisions), `e2e-units` (integer `/min`, decimal `Cel`, quantity → `e2e-dose-units` mg/g/kg with default mg), `e2e-pagination-001..018`, plus org-tagged subject-* trio for the nurse permission set. Frontend fixtures: mostly inline JSON `Buffer`s passed to `input[type=\"file\"].setInputFiles({name, mimeType, buffer})`; `questionnaireImportClone` writes a real temp file via `fs.mkdtempSync(os.tmpdir())`; `questionnaireImportUrl` `page.route()`s `https://questionnaire-fixtures.example/export.json`. `tests/fixtures/questionnaires/enableWhenTest.json` is seeded by `tests/setup/questionnaire.setup.ts` (id cached to `tests/.auth/questionnaireMeta.json`, read by `tests/support/questionnaireId.ts`) and is **not** used by any spec in these two directories — only by `tests/facility/patient/encounter/forms/enableWhen/{boolean,string}.spec.ts`.\n\n**Redesign guidance.** The cheapest compatible path is to preserve accessible names verbatim